      "changelog_entries": 2,
      "highlights": [
        "Added: **Shared Utilities Package**: Created `esmd_shared` package to eliminate code duplication",
        "Added: Enhanced `EsmdAuthClient` with token caching, better error handling, and type hints",
        "Changed: **Type Hints**: Added comprehensive type annotations throughout shared utilities",
        "Fixed: **Code Duplication**: Eliminated duplicate files across modules",
        "Fixed: **Import Issues**: Fixed circular imports and dependency issues",
        "Added: **ProviderDeliveryAck**:  Added the Provider Delivery Ack module with proper logging and exception handling.",
        "Added: **AuthAPI**: Added code to enforce the required User-Agent header, as some clients were not populating this header. The User-Agent header is mandatory for all API calls.",
        "Fixed: **NotificationScheduler**: Fixed invalid search parameters by replacing them with valid parameters, updated the request/response processing logic, and added logging.",
        "Fixed: **DocumentRefScheduler**: Fixed invalid search parameters by replacing them with valid parameters, updated the request/response processing logic, and added logging."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "key_changes": [
    "libyears: Added Measure explicitly selected declared Ruby groups with repeatable",
    "libyears: Added Measure direct RubyGems dependencies from a bounded root `Gemfile.lock` snapshot,",
    "libyears: Changed Upgrade JSON output from schema v2 to schema v3. This is an intentional",
    "codejson-schemas: Added `identifier` field \u2014 a persistent unique ID used to track an asset across renames/migrations. Added to `properties` (right after `name`) and to `required`.",
    "codejson-schemas: Added `downloads` property added to `reuseFrequency.properties`, alongside the existing `forks` and `clones`.",
    "codejson-schemas: Changed `$id` updated to `https://gsa-share-it.github.io/code-json-schema.json` (reflecting the repository's move from the `DSACMS` org to `GSA-SHARE-IT`).",
    "codejson-schemas: Added `feedbackMechanism` (singular)",
    "codejson-schemas: Added `version`, `homepageURL`, `downloadURL`, `disclaimerURL`, `disclaimerText`, `relatedCode`, `reusedCode`, `partners` added as optional fields, taken from original [M-16-21 code.json schema](https://github.com/GSA/code-gov-data/tree/master/schemas)",
    "codejson-schemas: Changed Migrated `$schema` dialect from `draft-04` to `2020-12` and introduced a formal `$id` (`https://dsacms.github.io/code-json-schema.json`).",
    "codejson-schemas: Added `identifier` field \u2014 a persistent unique ID used to track an asset across renames/migrations. Added to `properties` (right after `name`) and to `required`.",
    "codejson-schemas: Added `downloads` property added to `reuseFrequency.properties`, alongside the existing `forks` and `clones`.",
    "codejson-schemas: Changed `permissions.usageType`",
    "esmd-ext-fhir-client-python: Added **Shared Utilities Package**: Created `esmd_shared` package to eliminate code duplication",
