    "esmd-ext-fhir-client-python: Added **AuthAPI**: Added code to enforce the required User-Agent header, as some clients were not populating this header. The User-Agent header is mandatory for all API calls.",
    "esmd-ext-fhir-client-python: Fixed **NotificationScheduler**: Fixed invalid search parameters by replacing them with valid parameters, updated the request/response processing logic, and added logging.",
